35  98.83-101.08  because pepper that cost little in Kerala
36 101.39-103.91  sold for many times as much in Europe.
37 104.61-107.40  Chapter three. Traders Become Raiders.
38 108.00-110.31  The next fleet, under Pedro Cabral,
39 110.65-114.06  set up a trading post in Kalikut in fifteen hundred.
40 114.36-115.62  Locals attacked it,
41 115.92-117.76  and several Portuguese died.
