52 145.60-147.84  Chapter four. Rule the Water.
53 148.44-151.70  In fifteen-oh-five, Portugal sent its first governor,
54 152.07-155.11  Francisco de Al-may-da, with a simple plan:
55 155.53-157.86  forget the land, control the water.
