95 270.02-271.92  Chapter seven. The Fall.
96 272.52-274.76  The worst blow came in Bengal.
97 275.06-278.60  At Hoog-lee, Portuguese traders ran a cruel slave trade,
98 279.02-281.58  seizing Hindu and Muslim children,
99 281.65-286.55  and, chroniclers say, even took two slave girls of Empress Mum-taz Mahal.
